| **3** | **Capilano Suspension Bridge Park** – nature/adventure | New **“Night‑Glow”** light‑show (Oct‑Mar) + upgraded **Treetops Adventure** zip‑line | 9 AM – 5 PM (last entry 4:30 PM) | CAD 69 (adult) / CAD 34 (child 6‑12) | 3735 Capilano Rd, North Vancouver V7R 4J1 | 137‑m bridge, Cliffwalk, rainforest canopy, night‑time illumination |
